  (text "3 Logic: 5 V for the base, I/O expander, ports" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 3.81 3.81) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c6e1fea1-3cfc-5779-b068-9cacdb5be5bf"))
  (text "TPS62933 from LIGHT_BUS (dock or pack, 11-16.8 V; not the charger, so the base runs without a charger board):" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2421b83b-2d69-5520-a0ea-bed176782e62"))
  (text "5 V, 3 A max, 500 kHz (RT open), FB 52.3k/10k = 4.98 V. L2 6.8 uH is a starting point (datasheet's inductor table)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 49.53 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3ab98cd8-6bd9-5cc3-95c9-c6f9fca1585b"))
  (text "TCA9534 at 0x20 (A0-A2 = GND): P0 LIGHT_OFF, P1 PACK_OFF (outputs); P3 EFUSE_PG (input); P2, P4-P7 spare." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "efe4a39f-c436-5413-aa52-39c7da07f2c1"))
  (text "Power I2C (BQ25798 0x6B, INA228 0x40, TCA9534 0x20, keypad 0x21-0x27) on its own bus from the Waveshare board;" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 57.15 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1d24cd37-836c-56a7-8900-b065d4c0d557"))
  (text "pull-ups here. J6 to the Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-3.49 V2: 1 +5V out, 2 GND, 3 +3V3 in (pull-ups and logic)," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "68751399-7623-55a5-bb9a-3c2e6c6798e9"))
  (text "4 SDA, 5 SCL, 6 INT (open-drain, shared by everything on the bus), 7 dock UART, 8 dock detect." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 64.77 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c9f270e6-ef30-55f1-bc86-c5e80d92f59c"))
  (text "Charger port: J10 (XT30, DOCK_VIN out to the charger), J11 (XT30, the charger's battery output into PACK_F)," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ef354166-7d14-576d-838c-4c986c72ea06"))
  (text "J12 (JST-GH 6: 1 GND, 2 +3V3, 3 SDA, 4 SCL, 5 INT, 6 +5V). Plan B: last year's 60 W + 140 W USB-C modules on J10/J11." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 72.39 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9af9a789-e686-5e0d-8eaa-c50677f91329"))
  (text "Keypad port: J9, the same JST-GH 6 pinout (the keypad's expander shares INT). Leave the Waveshare battery header empty." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 76.2 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9c82f955-751b-5bb8-9381-031ff8ba9cc4"))
